.TH MERMAN-CLI-THEME-EXPORT 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.11.0" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-theme\-export \- Export an editable v2 document for a native preset
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli theme export\fR [\fB\-\-minimal\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIPRESET_ID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export an editable v2 document for a native preset
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-minimal\fR
Export a small template that extends the preset
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Output file. Defaults to stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIPRESET_ID\fR>
Built\-in Merman preset to export
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
